  "description": "Momento is a rich oriental fragrance that blends warm spices, amber sweetness, and deep woody notes into a bold and memorable composition. The scent delivers a luxurious Middle Eastern character with smooth warmth and elegant depth. The opening introduces aromatic spices and subtle sweetness that create an inviting and warm first impression. The heart develops into rich amber and smooth woody notes, adding depth and sophistication to the fragrance. The base settles into musk, woods, and soft sweetness, leaving a warm, long-lasting trail that feels powerful and refined. Momento is perfect for those who enjoy warm amber fragrances with spicy depth and a smooth woody finish.",
